ASDMA-2g,/28l2022-DRR - ASDMA-Assam State Disaster Management
in 2025-26 for RG Flood (DBT).54. L4= Ex Post Facto approval of fund released to DCs &ASDMA in2025-26 for RG Fire/Storm/Ex-Gratia etc. (DBT)
Resolution: SEC accorded ex post facto approval for an amount of Rs.964.9L800 lakhs released by the Revenue & DM Department to DCs andASDMA for RG Fire/Storm/Ex-Gratia etc. (DBT) during the period of 2025-26 asplaced at Annexure-Vll54. 15: Ex Post Facto approval for a total budget amounting toRs,17545.OO Lakhs released as advance budget under SDRF to thedistricts for repairing of damaged infrastructure against differentsectors under respective departmentsResolution: SEC accorded ex post facto approval for an amount of Rs.17545.00 lakhs released by the Revenue & DM Department as advancebudget under SDRF to the districts for repairing of damaged infrastructureagainst different sectors under respective departments as placed atAnnexure-Vlll54. 16: Ex Post facto Approval for an amount of Rs. L3O47.44629Lakh released by the Revenue & DM Depaftment to the DCs. CDCs,SDO (C) and ASDMA for GR FloodResolution: SEC accorded ex post facto approval for an amount of Rs.L3O47.44629 lakhs released by the Revenue & DM Department to the DCs.CDCs, SDO (C) and ASDMA for GR Flood as placed at Annexure-lX54. L7: Ex Post facto Approval for an amount of Rs. 87.87053 Lakhreleased by the Revenue & DM Department to the DCs and CDCs forGR CycloneResolution: SEC accorded ex post facto approval for an amount of Rs.87.87053 lakhs released by the Revenue & DM Department to the DCs. CDCs,for GR Cyclone as placed at Annexure-X54, 18: Ex- Post facto approval amounting to Rs. 97.29869 lakh forcommissioning of the Doppler Weather Radars (DWR) at Guwahati,Tezpur and SilcharResolution: SEC accorded ex post facto approval for an amount of Rs.97.29869 lakhs for commissioning of the Doppler Weather Radars (DWR) atGuwahati, Tezpur and Silchar as stated below:1. Guwahati Site- Rs.79.85380 lakh2. Tezpur Site- Rs. 10.51855 !akh3. Silchar Site- Rs. 6.92634 !akhSEC further directed ASDMA to ensure that the Doppler Weather Radars arecommissioned effectively by December 2025.54. 19: Apprisal on amendment of Assam State DisasterManagement Rules 2O1O enabling State Disaster ManagementAuthority to make regulations governing the selvice conditions ofASDMA employees.Resolution: SEC took note of the amendment made to the Assam State
l/ 1?7 7 642 / 202s

