ASDMA-29/28l2O22-DRR - ASDMA-Assam State Disaster Management
RIKA (School Safety)Water Resources DepartmentSoil Conservation departmentPWD Roadslrrigation department
l/1277642/2025
Minutes of the 54th State Executive Committee (SEC)meeting held on October 9, 2025 in the ConferenceHall of the Chief Secretary, Assam, Lok Sewa Bhaw?h,Dispur
List of members present is enclosed as Annexure IAt the outset of the meeting, the Chairperson of the State ExecutiveCommittee (SEC) welcomed the members present.The Additional Chief Secretary to the Government of Assam, Revenue &Disaster Management Department & Chief Executive Officer, ASDMApresented the agenda before the committee for necessary direction.After deliberation on the agenda the following resolutions were made.54.1: Confirmation of minutes of the 53rd Meeting of SECResolution: The State Executive Committee confirmed the minutes of its53rd meeting held on April 9,2025.54.2: Action Taken Repoft on the decisions of 53rd SEC meetingResolution: The State Executive Committee took note of the Action TakenReport and gave the following directions:
1. Home & Political Department to resolve the issues regarding procurement ofFire Proximity Suits by Fire & Emergency Services, Assam as per direction ofUp-Lokayukta/ Court Order and explore possibility to complete theprocurement of Fire Proximity Suits as the matter is related to providingemergency services.2. Home & Political Department, Fire & Emergency Services, Assam andRevenue & DM Department to jointly resolve the issues related toprocurement of equipments for expansion & modernization of Fire Services inthe State under XV Finance Commission.3. SEC also directed the Fire & Emergency Services, Assam to expedite thematter so that the fund already received under the XV Finance Commission isutilised urgently and also next instalment of fund can be sought from theGovernment of lndia within the stipulated time line of XV FinanceCommission.54. 3: Approval of proposals under State Disaster Mitigation FundResolution: SEC approved the 28 DPRs under State Disaster Mitigation Fund(SDMF) as placed at Annexure-ll for the following departments / Agency:
